<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="sampling" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="p9" name="9 ODAG1 weekly"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="c1" value="ODAG1 weekly sample (UMCM / ODAG1 / WKLY, rules 201–270): rule order and the bucket tree" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1400" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="A. The order the 35 rules run, and where each result is kept" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Step" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="95" width="620" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Result kept in" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="95" width="460" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Read: every query runs once, its result is stamped on each case in memory" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=3;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="125" width="800" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="1. Load the config row and the 35 active rules, sorted by Seq_Nbr then Rule_ID, split by class" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="159" width="620" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="GOVT_RGLTRY_SamplingRun (RUNNING) + GOVT_RGLTRY_SamplingRunRule (35 